<title>USA: Western Ohio names Heckman interim CEO.</title>
<headline>Western Ohio names Heckman interim CEO.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD, Ohio 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Ohio Financial Corp said it named John Heckman as Interim Chief Executive following the death earlier this week of President and CEO C. William Clark.</p>
<p>Western Ohio said Heckman had been serving as Executive Vice President-Financial Operations.</p>
